{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14108340","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14108340","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1410834001:1":{"text":"아름다워... 이게 바로 헥토르 님께서 직접 만드신 전설의 무기인건가!","source_cn":"太漂亮了……这就是赫托亲手所铸的传奇！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x635A6B56BEF6A5A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1410834002:1":{"text":"톱니바퀴가 맞물리고, 활시위를 당겨 먼 곳의 적을 반드시 맞춘다는 위대하고 찬란한, <style=\"highlight\">둔가엘</style>!","source_cn":"齿轮交错运转，万里逐敌，开弓必中！伟大而闪耀的<sty...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE083CE459422A97","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410834003:1":{"text":"...들으셨습니까?","source_cn":"……你们听到了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23B9101B909ABCAC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410834004:0":{"text":"둔가엘이 낸 진동 소리를 말하는 거야?","source_cn":"你是指杜恩加尔刚才的震鸣声吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x634A2FDE630CD422","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410834005:0":{"text":"역시 신의 작품이야... 자신만의 영혼을 가지고 있어! 하... 나는 절대 흉내내지 못할 솜씨라니까...","source_cn":"不愧是神的造物……它拥有自己的灵魂！唉……这就是我无法...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9836CEA9D040FC4C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1410834006:1":{"text":"아니요. 방금 전의 소리와는 다릅니다.","source_cn":"不，和刚才的声音不一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF12E53AF62554236","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410834007:1":{"text":"못 들었어. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 넌 뭔가 들었어?","source_cn":"我没听见。<style=stress><player_...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4567778056B2D112","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"못 들었어. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 넌 뭔가 들었어?","female":"못 들었어. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 넌 뭔가 들었어?","variant_male_record_index":"160391","variant_female_record_index":"160392","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1410834007":{"text":"못 들었어. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 넌 뭔가 들었어?","source_cn":"我没听见。<style=stress><player_name></style>，你听见了吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4567778056B2D112","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"못 들었어. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 넌 뭔가 들었어?","female":"못 들었어. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 넌 뭔가 들었어?","variant_male_record_index":"160391","variant_female_record_index":"160392","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1410834008:1":{"text":"속삭이는 게 아니라 굉장히 우렁찬 소리였는데 못 들으셨습니까?","source_cn":"它并不是在喃喃低语，它的声音很洪亮。你们听不到吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBD7D4E343DD89EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410834010:1":{"text":"인듀어, 대체 무슨 소리를 들은 거야?","source_cn":"因度厄，你听到什么了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92020D1FBD308837","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1410834011:1":{"text":"제 이름을 부르면서 <style=\"highlight\">자신을 들라고 명령</style>하고 있습니다.","source_cn":"它在呼唤我的名字，<style=highlight>命...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x325F4EE2927CA311","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1410834011":{"text":"제 이름을 부르면서 <style=\"highlight\">자신을 들라고 명령</style>하고 있습니다.","source_cn":"它在呼唤我的名字，<style=highlight>命令我拿起它</style>。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x325F4EE2927CA311","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1410834012:1":{"text":"네, 매우 강하고 힘찬 목소리였습니다.","source_cn":"对，是浑厚有力的嗓音。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC11BCCB9FA63A836","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1410834014:1":{"text":"그건... 아마 헥토르 님의 목소리일 거야.","source_cn":"我猜……是赫托老爹的声音。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51B8553EA46A962A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1410834015:1":{"text":"아아아...왜! 헥토르 님! 둔가엘은 우리 드워프 일족의 보물일 텐데...!","source_cn":"啊啊啊……为什么！赫托老爷子，杜恩加尔可是我们矮人一族...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1EA03F3DE5C4F85E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1410834016:1":{"text":"하지만... 하지만... 이게 헥토르 님의 뜻이라면... 그래!","source_cn":"但是……但是……如果这是赫托的意愿……好吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEAC8E3EB7E975E9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1410834017:1":{"text":"인듀어, 어서 둔가엘을 들어!","source_cn":"快！因度厄，去拿起杜恩加尔！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB86E495921F44619","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1410834018:1":{"text":"조아?","source_cn":"祖娅？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x366293B31DC58291","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1410834019:1":{"text":"내 말 들으라고! 둔가엘은 제물로 바쳐지기 위한 성물이 아니야. 그건 어둠을 꿰뚫는 불꽃이야!","source_cn":"你给我听好！杜恩加尔不是用来供奉的圣物，而是用来射穿黑...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x027ECD7362A2A51F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1410834020:1":{"text":"무기는 훌륭한 전사의 손에 쥐어져야 해.","source_cn":"作为一把武器，它值得被优秀的战士好好使用。","status":"match